('Four questions address different evidence.','Mechanism, ontogeny, function, and evolutionary history are complementary accounts of behavior.'),
('Proximate causes include developmental processes.','Immediate sensory and membrane mechanisms and the experience that builds behavior belong to the causal account.'),
